# Dry Run — environment template
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values:   cp .env.example .env.local
# .env.local is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# NOTE: Next.js reads env as a SNAPSHOT at server start.
# Restart `pnpm dev` after editing .env.local or your change won't be picked up.
#
# Vars prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ are inlined into the browser bundle (public!).
# Everything else is server-only — safe for secrets.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED NOW (Phase 1 — the talking spine)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# LLM brain — src/lib/brain.ts → askBrain()
# The SDK reads this implicitly: `new GoogleGenAI({})` picks it up by name.
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (free tier).
# Running on Gemini because the Anthropic API has no free tier; Claude swaps
# back in through the same askBrain() seam once credits exist.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOT YET READ BY THE CODE — uncomment when its phase lands
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# TTS (Phase 1.4) — the local Kokoro FastAPI server (tts-server/server.py).
# Currently hardcoded in src/lib/voice.ts; move it here when it needs to vary
# between local dev and a deployed host.
# KOKORO_TTS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/tts

# LLM brain, Claude swap (Phases 2–5 — needs ~$5 of credits minimum).
# console.anthropic.com → API keys. Claude-specific features (adaptive
# thinking, effort, tool use) start mattering from Phase 2 on.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# DB + auth + vector store (Phase 2 — Supabase: Postgres + pgvector/HNSW).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Python ML service (Phases 2–4) — embeddings, SER model, judge model.
# ML_SERVICE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001

# Code execution (Phase 3 — Piston, for running candidate code against tests).
# PISTON_URL=https://emkc.org/api/v2/piston

# Streaming STT (Phase 1.5 / 6) — only if we go hosted instead of local
# faster-whisper. Browser Web Speech is out: barge-in needs streaming.
# DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=
# ASSEMBLYAI_API_KEY=
